# QuotaFuse uses separate credentials for the proxy and Admin Usage collector.
# Run: npm ci && npm run setup
#
# Setup generates two private, Git-ignored files:
#   .env.proxy     contains QG_PROXY_TOKEN and OPENAI_API_KEY (project-scoped)
#   .env.collector contains OPENAI_ADMIN_KEY only
#
# Never combine OPENAI_API_KEY with OPENAI_ADMIN_KEY in the same process.
# Never commit real keys. See docs/deployment.md.
